  "details": {
   "description": "Ujala liquid detergent with instant dirt dissolvers (IDD) dissolves even the toughest dirt gently, protecting the colour and freshness of the fabric after washing. It has a 99.9% germ kill protection formula that keeps the clothes germ-free. It dissolves faster and gives an effective wash for both bucket and machine wash. So, discover an effortless washing experience with a beautiful mild fragrance that lifts your mood.",
   "ingredients": "Instant Dirt Dissolver, Refreshing Fragrance, Liquid Solution",
   "usageInstructions": "Bucket wash - Pour a cap of Ujala liquid in a bucket of water, and soak your clothes for 5 mins. Remove and dry them. Don't rinse the clothes again.\nSemi-automatic - Wash your clothes with detergent as usual. Pour 1 cap of Ujala liquid in the machine tub in clean water during the last rinse cycle.\nFront-load - Pour 1 cap of Ujala liquid in the softener/conditioner compartment at the same time as you add detergent.\nTop load - If your machine has a softener compartment, pour 1 cap of Ujala liquid at the start of a wash cycle. Otherwise, pour 1 cap of Ujala liquid in the machine tub during the last rinse cycle.\nAdd a small step of safe wash detergent to your regular laundry routine and experience unbelievable shine, visible softness and freshness.",
   "manufacturerName": "Jyothy Labs Ltd",
   "countryOfOrigin": "India"
